  "name": "BiPlay",
  "description": "BiPlay contains 9.7 hours of bimanual data collected with an aloha robot at the RAIL lab @ UC Berkeley, USA. It contains 7023 clips, 2000 language annotations and 326 unique scenes.\nPaper: https://huggingface.co/papers/2410.10088\nCode: https://github.com/sudeepdasari/dit-policy\nIf you use the dataset please cite:\n@inproceedings{dasari2025ingredients,\n  title={The Ingredients for Robotic Diffusion Transformers},\n  author={Sudeep Dasari and Oier Mees and Sebastian Zhao and Mohan Kumar Srirama\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/oier-mees/BiPlay.",
